sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer
    participant PaymentService
    participant BillerAdapter as BillerAdapter (AquaCo)
    participant Biller as AquaCo
    participant LedgerService
    participant NotificationService
    participant SMS as SMS provider

    Note over PaymentService,Biller: Payment is SENT_TO_BILLER, 352.50 is held
    PaymentService->>BillerAdapter: pay(payment)
    BillerAdapter->>Biller: SOAP payment request
    Biller-->>BillerAdapter: error code
    BillerAdapter-->>PaymentService: BillerRefused(mappedReason)

    PaymentService->>PaymentService: SENT_TO_BILLER to FAILED
    Note right of PaymentService: no fee is posted (fee only on COMPLETED)

    PaymentService->>LedgerService: HOLD_RELEASE (held minus 352.50, available plus 352.50)
    LedgerService-->>PaymentService: entries posted with MONEY audit
    PaymentService->>PaymentService: FAILED to REFUNDED

    PaymentService->>NotificationService: queuePaymentOutcome(payment)
    NotificationService->>SMS: send SMS with readable reason

    alt SMS delivered
        SMS-->>NotificationService: ok
        NotificationService-->>Customer: SMS - payment failed, money returned
    else provider down
        SMS-->>NotificationService: error
        NotificationService->>SMS: retry (up to 3 times)
        NotificationService->>NotificationService: still failing, mark UNDELIVERED
    end

    Note over Customer,SMS: An UNKNOWN payment is never refunded directly. It must first become FAILED (late refusal or reconciliation finds nothing), then follows this same flow.
